{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"pass\": false, \"problems\": [\"第1条实际依赖H2：‘刚才的满足’就是上一段已经建立的经历，不能标成‘依赖：无’。\", \"它能解释S03-B1的一部分，但解释偏泛：‘满足→放松→享受惬意’说明了舒服，却没有充分说明为什么此刻会进入一种停留在刚才、暂时不再向前、心神漂开的状态。\", \"S03-B2和S03-B3都没有得到去处，尤其B3持续数小节的受阻、滞留感不是可以随手丢掉的枝节。\"], \"unexplained\": [{\"id\": \"S03-B2\", \"why\": \"池子太窄\", \"note\": \"H1与H2已经足以提供材料：期待刚在亲近中获得方向，并不等于内心所有想说、想要的东西都已落定；短暂冒头又沉下去可以从这里解释，不必新增前史。\"},{\"id\": \"S03-B3\", \"why\": \"池子太窄\", \"note\": \"现有历史也足以容纳这种阻力：H2只是‘初次有了方向、尝到满足’，H1那种原本说不清的期待未必因此彻底澄清。顺畅亲近之后出现一点滞留，可以解释为满足并没有把原先的含混完全解决；无需另造人物秘密或外部事件。\"}], \"reason\": \"主体验抓到了‘满足后的松弛’，但因果还不够针对这一段特有的漂浮停留，而且两条有分量的段内变化完全未解释，所以不能判合格。\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8ade9e0b-7c58-4727-9e32-a7e6275c4c0e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T224959756060Z", "elapsed_seconds": 27.359, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T22:50:27.119045+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5d5f8dfd7112e70e7774ef994f52a5ab9921a04df1e174683fdce867418a9aa6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\